        <dl class="fc-meta-row">
          <dt>Resolution</dt><dd>YES if the US and Iran sign or formally announce a comprehensive final agreement that resolves Iran's nuclear program disposition and is confirmed by both State Dept and Iranian MFA before EOD 2026-08-17.</dd>
