          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>A further MOU extension or another framework document without final nuclear-program resolution = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO. Partial deal covering only Hormuz or sanctions without nuclear component = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO.</dd>
        </dl>
        <div class="fc-indicators">
